OL,3,GNEWSARepeat burglar caught by victim's
OL,4,Apublic appeal
OL,5,
OL,6,FA serial burglar who was caught after
OL,7,Fhis victim posted doorbell camera
OL,8,Ffootage of him online has been jailed
OL,9,Ffor three and a half years.
OL,11,FAnthony Coyles, 53, was recognised by a
OL,12,FSunderland shop worker he had tried to
OL,13,Fswap currency with hours after breaking
OL,14,Finto a woman's home and stealing cash
OL,15,Fand jewellery, Newcastle Crown Court
OL,16,Fheard.
OL,18,FSeveral weeks later Coyles and three
OL,19,Fassociates broke into a pub, smashed
OL,20,Fvarious items and stole bottles of
OL,21,Fspirit.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
